                                                             BUSINESS QUESTIONS
Does response time affect customer satisfaction?


                                                              Query:
SELECT 
    csat_score,
    ROUND(AVG(first_response_time_hrs),2) AS avg_first_response
FROM customer_support
WHERE csat_score IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY csat_score
ORDER BY csat_score;

                                                         Finding
The analysis didn't show a clear relationship between first response time and customer satisfaction. Some customers who received quick responses still gave low satisfaction scores, 
while others who waited longer gave similar ratings.


